---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Essays"
seoTitle: "Essays on Ohio Family Court Reform"
summary: "Long-form arguments for structural reform of Ohio's family courts, cited and steelmanned."
type: page
series:
  - "Institutional Architecture"
  - "Evidence and Due Process"
  - "Human Cost"
---
{% from "partials/card.njk" import card with context %}
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Essays</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ summary }} Essays argue. Each one states what it does not claim, answers its strongest objections, and links to the reform agenda.</p>
    <p class="meta-line"><a href="/essays/feed.xml">Atom feed</a> · Philosophy and framework pieces live under <a href="/foundations/">Foundations</a>.</p>
  </header>

  {% for s in series %}
    <section class="series" aria-labelledby="series-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h2 id="series-{{ loop.index }}">{{ s }}</h2>
      <div class="card-list">
         {# A `set` inside the loop below would not survive it, so collect into an array. #}
         {% set inSeries = [] %}
        {% for item in collections.essays %}
           {% if item.data.series == s %}{% set _ = inSeries.push(item) %}{{ card(item) }}{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
         {% if not inSeries.length %}<p class="empty">Forthcoming.</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>